OL,3,GNEWSAClean-up begins as oil spill shuts
OL,4,A18 Kent beaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FMike Humber, director for the
OL,7,Fenvironment at the council, told BBC
OL,8,FSouth East: "We never want to be saying
OL,9,Fto the public to not go on the beaches,
OL,10,Fbut we have taken that decision to
OL,11,Fprotect the public."
